## Combining multiple triggers

You can list multiple triggers under `on:` — the workflow runs when any of them fire:

```yaml
on:
  push:
  pull_request:
  schedule:
    - cron: '0 0 * * 1'    # also runs every Monday at midnight
  workflow_dispatch:         # also runnable manually
```

